  characterName: Kawashima Ami
  description: She's become as wealthy as her mother and so famous that she needs
    bodyguards. She started branching out of modelling to become an actress. She's
    also really close to Taiga and Ryuuji's daughters, hanging out with them every
    now and then. She even helped to purchase Taiga and Ryuuji's new home for them.
